 "best_idea": "A zone director spawns only while players are present, checks a total cap and then a per-entry cap before a weighted pick, holds a fixed group that respawns on a lives counter, and despawns on empty only after a grace timer that re-checks the count when it fires.",
 "decision": "adapt",
 "decision_why": "Frankendom's zone population needs caps, presence gating, lives and grace timers, all as zone data. The donor's counter-based presence and building-level math do not fit; presence should be recomputed on the server from zone membership.",
